&lt;li&gt;Set and hold a high quality bar across all channels, using data to identify gaps and drive measurable improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a senior escalation point for complex cases requiring coordination across Legal, Compliance, Fraud, Engineering, or executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally to ensure support teams are prepared for product launches, regulatory changes, and operational shifts — and that customer signals inform what we build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify what&#39;s broken, build the case for change, and own outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
